{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27928","headline":"题崔驸马林亭 · 朱庆余","name":"题崔驸马林亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"选居幽近御街东，易得诗人聚会同。\n白练鸟飞深竹里，朱弦琴在乱书中。\n亭开山色当高枕，楼静箫声落远风。\n何事宦涂犹寂寞，都缘清苦道难通。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱庆余","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27928.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27928","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}